{"headword":"אֲדָמָה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. ground, land (</strong>as <em>tilled</em>, Ger. <em>bebaut</em>? Dl<sup>Pr 105</sup>, but Fleisch. (Merx<sup>Archiv I, 236 f</sup>) comp. Ar. <span dir=\"rtl\">أَدَمَة</span> <em>skin</em>, as smoothly covering & close-fitting; √<span dir=\"rtl\">דם</span> cf. Ar. <span dir=\"rtl\">دَمَّ</span> <em>smear</em> (spread over surface); cf. also Nö<sup>ZMG 1886, 737</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:25\" href=\"/Genesis.1.25\">Gn 1:25</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַדְמַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:20\" href=\"/Genesis.47.20\">Gn 47:20</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַדְמָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 31:38\" href=\"/Job.31.38\">Jb 31:38</a> + 2 textual etc.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲדָמוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 49:12\" href=\"/Psalms.49.12\">ψ 49:12</a>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>ground</em> (as tilled, yielding sustenance) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:5\" href=\"/Genesis.2.5\">Gn 2:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:9\" href=\"/Genesis.2.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:17\" href=\"/Genesis.3.17\">3:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:23\" href=\"/Genesis.3.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:2\" href=\"/Genesis.4.2\">4:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:3\" href=\"/Genesis.4.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:12\" href=\"/Genesis.4.12\">12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:29\" href=\"/Genesis.5.29\">5:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:21\" href=\"/Genesis.8.21\">8:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:25\" href=\"/Genesis.19.25\">19:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:23\" href=\"/Genesis.47.23\">47:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:26\" href=\"/Exodus.34.26\">Ex 34:26</a> (all J); <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:19\" href=\"/Exodus.23.19\">Ex 23:19</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.13\">Dt 7:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.17\">11:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 26:2\" href=\"/Deutero